	<section id="why-choose" class="py-20 px-4 bg-black">
		<div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl">
			<div class="text-center mb-12">
				<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
					What Makes SDF Clothing Your Ideal CMT & Full-Package Partner
				</h2>
			</div>
			
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
				<div class="snake-card p-8">
					<div class="text-4xl font-bold text-red-500 mb-4">📦</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">Low MOQ Clothing Manufacturing</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
						Unlike large garment factories that demand 5,000+ pieces, SDF Clothing offers low minimum order quantities starting at just 300 pieces per style. Perfect for startups, boutique brands, and new product launches. Multiple size and color combinations available within your MOQ.
					</p>
				</div>
				
				<div class="snake-card p-8">
					<div class="text-4xl font-bold text-red-500 mb-4">✓</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">Certified Quality Manufacturer</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
						As a certified apparel manufacturer, we hold GOTS (organic), OEKO-TEX (safety), ISO 9001 (quality management), BSCI (social compliance), and SEDEX (ethical trade) certifications. Our quality control process covers every stage: fabric inspection, inline QC, and final AQL inspection before shipment.
					</p>
				</div>
				
				<div class="snake-card p-8">
					<div class="text-4xl font-bold text-red-500 mb-4">🔄</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">Full Package Manufacturing</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
						From initial concept to finished garments at your 
						doorstep. SDF Clothing is your single-source 
						clothing manufacturer. Services include: tech pack development, pattern making, sample approval, bulk production, custom labels & packaging, and global logistics management.
					</p>
				</div>
				
				<div class="snake-card p-8">
					<div class="text-4xl font-bold text-red-500 mb-4">⚡</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">Fast Production Turnaround</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
						Our high-capacity garment factory delivers up to 50,000 pieces within 45 days production lead time. With streamlined processes, dedicated production lines, and strict deadline management, SDF Clothing meets your delivery deadlines consistently, with production updates provided throughout.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	
